==Battleground==
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 2.67~5.33 seconds<sup>80f~160f</sup>.
*4 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 5.33~8 seconds<sup>160f~240f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Goddess of Abundance - Freya (Enemy)|Freya]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~6 seconds<sup>90f~180f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Junior God Suruzu (Enemy)|Suruzu]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Junior God Brynhildr (Enemy)|Brynhildr]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Doge]] spawns.
**1 [[Doge]] spawns.
**1 [[Doge]] spawns.
**1 [[Junior God of Light - Valkyrie (Enemy)|Valkyrie]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage is rather difficult due to the high magnifications the enemies are at, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] can help immensely as well as any high DPS units like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]].

